[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3042042936","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108313#issuecomment-3042042936","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108313","id":3042042936,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc61UeQ4","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-06T15:45:25Z","updated_at":"2025-07-06T15:45:25Z","body":"Error 3 is `ERR_NET_ADDRESS_INVALID_OR_UNAVAILABLE`, so it might be address/port number conflict related to multiple running instances of LSP or debugger.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3042042936/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3094420956","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108313#issuecomment-3094420956","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108313","id":3094420956,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc64cR3c","user":{"login":"Infini-Creation","id":136735040,"node_id":"U_kgDOCCZpQA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136735040?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infini-Creation","html_url":"https://github.com/Infini-Creation","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infini-Creation/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infini-Creation/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infini-Creation/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infini-Creation/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infini-Creation/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infini-Creation/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infini-Creation/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infini-Creation/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infini-Creation/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-20T10:17:45Z","updated_at":"2025-07-31T08:26:52Z","body":"Got it today for no reason with v4.5.beta3.official [4d1f26e1f] on windows 10. Just pure GDScript project.\n\nHave two instances of the editor running at the same time with two different projects.\n\nWith one, I edit project settings to increase _Max Call Stack_ parameter and enable _Verbose stdout_ (absolutely no idea if it's relevant or not here), save & restart editor => spam of errors, editor being unusable at all.\n\nIt looks like it happens only with this project, tried another one (which project settings hasn't been modified the same way), no issue.\n\nClosing all instances of the editor, opening just one with the project which trigger the issue => it's ok. Weird, it never did this before.\n\nFirst, it's pointless to loop on such an error, there is barely any chance it will magically solve itself so quickly, better to display a popup error dialog with the port trying to be bound.\n\nSecond, except for all known standard reserved ports (<= 1024 AFAIK), any other are free to use by ANY program, so if dev A create some tool and decide to use port P, and Godot team pick a random port which is the same port P, both tools cannot be used simultaneously on the same host (same apply the opposite way.) Better to check if port is free first, try an alternate defined in config then ultimately display an error message and a way to choose a different port.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3094420956/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3189539436","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108313#issuecomment-3189539436","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108313","id":3189539436,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6-HIJs","user":{"login":"Infini-Creation","id":136735040,"node_id":"U_kgDOCCZpQA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136735040?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infini-Creation","html_url":"https://github.com/Infini-Creation","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infini-Creation/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infini-Creation/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infini-Creation/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infini-Creation/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infini-Creation/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infini-Creation/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infini-Creation/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Infini-Creation/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.githu